{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"db8a1ac6541f9911","type":"group","x":-11080,"y":-2480,"width":20690,"height":4480,"color":"6","label":"PENNY, Misc. Metacommunications, Et Al"},
		{"id":"c47b0c8c39901c06","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Metacommunication/Excalidraw Drawings/Unknown PHOTON Drawing.png","x":-5520,"y":-1168,"width":399,"height":254},
		{
			"id":"324bb4dc29af9ba8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This has also been referred to as 'Therapy' and 'THERAPY' independently.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5520,
			"y":-860,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"5375edfca7f8f7f9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Vigenère cipher as far as we know, no known key",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4900,
			"y":-860,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"43037e2fe5d8c1ce",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"A prim and proper boy. \nA crying, crying girl. \\[**ziexxbinselpqfeeagvmbpgmtxkbaqk**\\] \nA crying, crying girl.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4900,
			"y":-1054,
			"width":400,
			"height":140,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"4fa038861e37ca58","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Metacommunication/Excalidraw Drawings/Unknown drawning.png","x":-5616,"y":-1770,"width":660,"height":559},
		{"id":"472e37d17cf7ecd5","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/PENNY, The Device/PENNY/Penny.png","x":-6300,"y":-1211,"width":327,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f526101511aeaf4d","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Metacommunication/Excalidraw Drawings/Penny Thank You.png","x":-6300,"y":-1752,"width":400,"height":132},
		{"id":"52590532278f3784","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/PENNY, The Device/PENNY/PENNY Account.png","x":-5932,"y":-1168,"width":372,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"8ff0fc2b8f4c4e8e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Iconography based on the platforming sections in Ch.5",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5932,
			"y":-1271,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"51624c48cf2c9dc2","type":"link","url":"https://mourningdew.phinarina.xyz/interview/","x":-7420,"y":-1770,"width":1080,"height":3720,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"62218c39015a4aee","type":"link","url":"https://mourningdew.phinarina.xyz/G7DVlrUSVH244QLHOOQ/","x":-5760,"y":-1840,"width":140,"height":200},
		{"id":"c416b9365beefed5","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Consultations/Data/Color Distribution.png","x":-5220,"y":1170,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b78303993d679cc0","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Canvases/Consultations/Consultations.canvas","portal":true,"x":-4320,"y":-1980,"width":13930,"height":3040},
		{
			"id":"b449b77bc2e32e28",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Apparently a red herring.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5820,
			"y":-1960,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"8829d2dd08755bf7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Kris has been depicted wearing a sweater emblazed with the DELTA RUNE; angel crest right on the chest like whoever - whatever, this is. Is it a standardized uniform for the town, or...?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5506,
			"y":-1960,
			"width":440,
			"height":120,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"98146ea1c57989fe","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Consultations/Data/Shape Distribution.png","x":-5220,"y":1480,"width":400,"height":299,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"9f36125e5cd98876",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Thank you.\nYour names were many.\nYou took many forms.\n\nYour choices mattered.\n\nFurther communication\nWill not resemble this.\n\nUntil next time,\n... You recieved a score of \"\".",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-5513,
			"y":1160,
			"width":253,
			"height":300,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"6b9963ffce8097f9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Alphys being referred to as a 'stagehand' and this thought experiment - are the dark worlds we'll explore effectively plays enacting the events of prophecy beat for beat?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-6160,
			"y":1160,
			"width":400,
			"height":120,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"775c91187afc1bbb","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Consultations/Data/Validity Distribution.png","x":-3740,"y":1480,"width":486,"height":299,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"827cfee5f08bc1ba","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Consultations/Data/Wronged Distribution.png","x":-4260,"y":1480,"width":481,"height":299,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"03344a91cc6b6ba6","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Consultations/Data/Recognition Distribution.png","x":-4780,"y":1480,"width":486,"height":299,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"99473371695fabd3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"'Susie' and 'SUSIE' - This is probably a data entry thing, but...",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-4690,
			"y":1340,
			"width":307,
			"height":90,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"ce3787f86dbdd1c1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"PENNY's able to respond to this board, as she has the other boards before now. ...And call me out! Twice!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-7760,
			"y":400,
			"width":280,
			"height":120,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"7d1bd5baa6cfea25",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"It's important they allow us to do this; right now?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-7760,
			"y":320,
			"width":280,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"8a800f6b6c569f87",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"What's so dangerous about bringing up the good doctor's henchsquad?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-6220,
			"y":740,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"a9cd1e5a7742dd1d","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Consultation/CONSULTATION.md","x":-5946,"y":-688,"width":1126,"height":1798,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"53fbf6834fcce54e","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Consultation/Score Calculation.md","x":-4760,"y":240,"width":400,"height":1070,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f9b21a6d466c0f72","type":"link","url":"https://mourningdew.phinarina.xyz/interview2/","x":-8720,"y":-674,"width":880,"height":1528,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"d16b9ba317b166d9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Kris ostensibly made one of these questions, and considering the timeline of how this interview played out - I have reason to believe it's the last, calling back to the 'Thank you.' ARG along with the emails we've received thusfar.\n\nIn that ARG, you received \"So, she never stopped smiling.\" as a response for inputting 0-10 Seconds as an answer.\n\nKris' consultation notably stated they were hurt by Noelle.\n\n...What's up with all of this?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-7760,
			"y":-160,
			"width":280,
			"height":460,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"f894064b2c7da9d6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"THERAPY is notably capitalized here. 'More of a life'... has some implications I can't extrapolate too well.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-7760,
			"y":-300,
			"width":280,
			"height":120,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"bddd4a6edbd18681","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Metacommunication/Concept Art/Yo Dawg, I Heard You Like DELTA RUNE, So I Put A DELTA RUNE inside your ANGEL.png","x":-6300,"y":-780,"width":175,"height":108,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"5fc7776a59eb984c","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Metacommunication/Discord Hints/Indoctrination.png","x":-6148,"y":1320,"width":376,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"6a00e877b6c835f3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Undyne's probably in with the church, with that sort of text.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-6220,
			"y":600,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"7ac378a61eff195a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"'An interesting coincidence.' was the phrase used to describe being named after a character in DELTARUNE proper. Why do these two keep that?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-6220,
			"y":180,
			"width":260,
			"height":189,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"627a458a1c0b6456",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This is most likely supposed to depict Monster Kid?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-6220,
			"y":460,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"60ce06e464c7ae31","type":"link","url":"https://mourningdew.phinarina.xyz/interview3/","x":-10520,"y":-2400,"width":1300,"height":4350,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"0970119eceb258ae",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"More allusions to Chara's speech / UNDERTALE's metanarrative about growing too attached to something you know inside and out...\nI worry for what repeatedly invoking as much means.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":-2200,
			"width":400,
			"height":160,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"1c176809be2c2f94",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"What circumstances led to things getting to that point? Did... anyone besides Kris make it off the cutting room floor, so to speak?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":-1600,
			"width":400,
			"height":140,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"71f2b4e3898e8dfd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"I'm 50/50 on if this means something but she's also just... so real for it. Actually.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":-1300,
			"width":400,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"c6f4b54f5890d9a4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Just as I hope there is a way for DELTARUNE and MOURNINGDEW to exist moving forwards; I personally extend that same philosophy to PENNY and her objective. Whatever that may be.\n\nNot everything... has the happiest ending. Sometimes, art wanders where it needs, even if that's not what you'd personally want, or believe possible. But it's okay to hope, so long as you don't feel like that hope is owed as truth back to you.\nI've always believed that. \n...Is that silly to put in a comment like this?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":-1200,
			"width":520,
			"height":280,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"ea780229822e78e4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This might be implying there won't be a \"new fountain on the horizon\" in this version of the tale; and there won't be a sealing - only a visit, and an exit?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":-880,
			"width":440,
			"height":120,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"f8e1d51b6a489f7d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"There might be a way to go off the path the town has laid out for us, is my gut read.\n\n...I can only hope it would be better for all involved. And. I'm very thankful there won't be another 🟥.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":-460,
			"width":420,
			"height":160,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"52e06875d0af0d9b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Well, we're of a mind on this.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":-160,
			"width":420,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"164eaccd4da8356c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"PENNY is aware of who Kris is; and while they don't blame them - is aware that they ultimately pushed things over the edge. Grimly interesting.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":200,
			"width":420,
			"height":100,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"0e1fdc78f7be283a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"If I see NORMALNPC outside my door, I'm answering. /j",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":500,
			"width":420,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"ecf01bec551aeef5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"PENNY also has a sense of humor.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":740,
			"width":420,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"ed6bb826fbba4f5d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Y'know; this is on me for thinking anything to do with Tricky Tony's work wouldn't involve Synchronicity or something related to it.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":900,
			"width":420,
			"height":100,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"2b0115ef2e76d7de",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"I did not have PENNY being part of a system on my bingo card, but I'm here for it.\n\nAlso, it's a neat circumstantial pun.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-9160,
			"y":1660,
			"width":300,
			"height":140,
			"color":"1"
		}
	],
